   at finalize).  Needs WORD_SUB_VAL_EQ_0 (from tail_ddlt_wide.ml).  27-step DDK sim +
   z-preservation (READ_OVER_WRITE) + X23 value bridge (ARITH) + 2 condition iffs (k,k+1). *)
