(* ============================================================================
   winup_d.ml (cont108) -- BIGNUM_MOD_WINUP_D.
   Strengthened BIGNUM_MOD_WINUP (bignum_mod.ml:1978): same 0x68->0x98 window+roundup
   block, but its 0x98 POST ALSO carries the ROUNDUP DISJUNCTION on val(read X5):
