   for d := val(read X5 @ 0x98) (the rounded window t0, the arg to word_recip).
   WINUP itself hides the roundup VALUE (its POST only gives ~(b=0)==>bit63 X5), which
   is why the CORRECT splice at 0x1a4 cannot currently derive the disjunction.

