   add #1 ; cinv eq) strengthened: after the two steps expose read X5 as the roundup
   expression, the disjunction is discharged by ROUNDUP_VAL_DISJ (raw := window,
   raw<2^64 from b<2^(bitsize b)); the original bit63 conjunct closes as in WINUP
   (ROUNDUP_MSB + MSB_VAL + WINDOW_RANGE).

