   Span 0x3bc (cbz) -> 0x3f0 (fall-through after cbnz).  Spectators r15/r20/r21/r23 threaded.
   Deps: NEGADD2_STEP (negadd2_helpers), NEGADD1_ADVANCE (negadd1_helpers), BIGNUM_MOD_EXEC.
